User: Triangle $ABC$ is an isosceles right triangle with a right angle at $A$. Segments $BD$ and $BE$ trisect angle $ABC$. What is the degree measure of angle $BDE$?

[asy]draw((0,0)--(-1,0)--(-1,1)--(0,0)--cycle,linewidth(2));
draw((0,0)--dir(165)*1/cos(pi/12),linewidth(2));
draw((0,0)--dir(150)*1/cos(pi/6),linewidth(2));
draw((-1,.07)--(-.93,.07)--(-.93,0),linewidth(1));

label("A",(-1,0),SW);
